{"speciesId":706,"names":{"fr":"Muplodocus","es":"Goodra","en":"Goodra","ja":"ヌメルゴン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon Dragon peu farouche aime faire la fête à son Dresseur adoré, le couvrant au passage de sa bave collante."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon de tipo Dragón muy afable al que le gusta abrazar con efusión a su Entrenador, aunque después lo deja totalmente pringado."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This very friendly Dragon-type Pokémon will hug its beloved Trainer, leaving that Trainer covered in sticky slime."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"人懐っこい ドラゴンポケモン。 大好きな トレーナーに 抱き着いて 粘液で ヌルヌルにしてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il attaque grâce à ses cornes extensibles. Ses coups sont aussi puissants que ceux de 100 boxeurs professionnels réunis."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ataca con sus antenas retráctiles, desplegando una fuerza comparable a los puñetazos de 100 boxeadores profesionales."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It attacks with retractable horns. It throws a punch that’s the equivalent of the force of a hundred pro boxers."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"伸び縮みする ツノで 攻撃。 プロボクサー １００人分の パンチに 匹敵する 威力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ce Pokémon Dragon peu farouche aime faire la fête à son Dresseur adoré, le couvrant au passage de sa bave collante."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pokémon de tipo Dragón muy afable al que le gusta abrazar con efusión a su Entrenador, aunque después lo deja totalmente pringado."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This very friendly Dragon-type Pokémon will hug its beloved Trainer, leaving that Trainer covered in sticky slime."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"人懐っこい ドラゴンポケモン。 大好きな トレーナーに 抱き着いて 粘液で ヌルヌルにしてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il attaque grâce à ses cornes extensibles. Ses coups sont aussi puissants que ceux de 100 boxeurs professionnels réunis."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ataca con sus antenas retráctiles, desplegando una fuerza comparable a los puñetazos de 100 boxeadores profesionales."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It attacks with retractable horns. It throws a punch that’s the equivalent of the force of a hundred pro boxers."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"伸び縮みする ツノで 攻撃。 プロボクサー １００人分の パンチに 匹敵する 威力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon adore la compagnie humaine. Si son Dresseur ne lui donne pas assez d’amour, il pleure à grosses larmes visqueuses."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es muy afable y cariñoso. Si lo ignoran, le invade la tristeza y llora lágrimas viscosas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"An amazingly friendly Pokémon, but if left to itself, loneliness overcomes it, and it oozes gooey tears."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"すごく 人懐っこい ポケモン。 構わないでいると 寂しくて ヌルヌルの 涙を 流し 鳴く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ceux qui l’importunent en le pensant inoffensif peuvent vite se retrouver du mauvais côté de ses cornes et goûter de sa puissante queue."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Golpea con sus antenas retráctiles y derriba con su gruesa cola a aquellos que se burlan de él creyendo que es inofensivo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It gets picked on because it’s meek. But then, whoever teased it gets to feel the full force of its horns and a good swatting from its thick tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"大人しいからと からかうと 角で 思い切り 突かれ 太い 尻尾で 薙ぎ払われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Très câlin, ce Pokémon a tendance à se frotter aux gens auxquels il s’attache avec son corps visqueux. Dresseurs de Muplodocus, tenez bon."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon muy amistoso que demuestra su afecto con abrazos viscosos y gelatinosos. Se necesita algo de estoicismo para no apartarse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s very friendly toward people. If you grow close to it, Goodra will hug you with its sticky, slime-covered body. Don’t get mad."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"とっても 人懐っこい。 懐くと ネバネバの 粘液に まみれた 身体で 抱きついてくるが 我慢だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Une épaisse couche de graisse se trouve sous sa peau visqueuse et lui permet d’encaisser les attaques ennemies."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Debajo de su resbaladiza piel cuenta con una voluminosa capa de grasa que le permite bloquear los ataques enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Underneath its slimy skin is a thick layer of fat, and the combination of the two makes enemies’ attacks slide right off."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ヌルヌルの 皮膚の 下には 分厚い 脂肪の 層が あり 敵の 攻撃を 受け流す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il arrive qu’il ne comprenne pas les ordres de son Dresseur et qu’il le regarde d’un air ahuri. Cette réaction adorable l’a rendu populaire."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"A veces no entiende las instrucciones de su Entrenador y se queda como abstraído, pero mucha gente encuentra este rasgo adorable."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Sometimes it misunderstands instructions and appears dazed or bewildered. Many Trainers don’t mind, finding this behavior to be adorable."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"トレーナーの 指示が 理解できずに キョトンとする ことが たまに あり その 様子が かわいいと 人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il attaque à l’aide de ses longues cornes. Ses coups sont cent fois plus puissants que ceux d’un champion poids lourds de boxe."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Ataca extendiendo sus largas antenas. La fuerza que despliega es 100 veces superior a la del puñetazo de un boxeador de peso pesado."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its form of offense is forcefully stretching out its horns. The strikes land 100 times harder than any blow from a heavyweight boxer."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"長い ツノを 伸ばす 勢いで 攻撃。 威力は ヘビー級 ボクサーの パンチの １００倍だ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Able to freely control the hardness of its metallic shell. It loathes solitude and is extremely clingy—it will fume and run riot if those dearest to it ever leave its side."}],"varieties":[{"id":706,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[15,"level-up",32],[16,"level-up",32],[17,"level-up",32],[18,"level-up",32],[20,"level-up",49],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",49],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"counter","learns":[[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"strength"